    },
    {
      "id": "claim_0115c424d2a246ebb4d0bbd5bc05296e",
      "statement": "Under the new protocol the server retries adding partitions on CONCURRENT_TRANSACTIONS, tuned by add.partitions.to.txn.retry.backoff.ms (default 20) and add.partitions.to.txn.retry.backoff.max.ms (default 100).",
